  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物群系大全</a></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/918/257/biomesoplenty.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1176\" height=\"480\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>概述</strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">动态树木模组让原版树木变得美丽、复杂且逼真。它对原版树木的改进如此之大，以至于相比之下其他模组的树木显得不堪入目。我制作此模组是为了将《生物群系大全》中的树木替换为动态版本，使其与动态树木模组的树木搭配时不会显得突兀。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>功能特性</strong></strong></h2>\n<h4><strong>新增树木：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>棕榈树</li>\n<li>橙秋树</li>\n<li>黄秋树</li>\n<li>枫树</li>\n<li>垂死之树</li>\n<li>枯树</li>\n<li>焦树</li>\n<li>繁花橡树</li>\n<li>蓝花楹</li>\n<li>彩虹桦树</li>\n<li>粉樱</li>\n<li>白樱</li>\n<li>地狱树皮树</li>\n<li>柳树</li>\n<li>冷杉</li>\n<li>桃花心木</li>\n<li>红杉</li>\n<li>幽影树</li>\n<li>魔法树</li>\n<li>黑杨</li>\n<li>云杉杨</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>新增蘑菇（需安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictreesplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees +</a>&nbsp;）：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>毒蝇伞</li>\n<li>荧光菇</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>不会被替换的树木</strong><strong>：</strong></h4>\n<h5>(1.21.1)</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>起源橡树（经典外观）</li>\n<li>苍穹之树（结构过于复杂，无法适配动态树木）</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>(1.16.5)</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>起源橡树（经典外观）</li>\n<li>红树林（无对应的红树林木材）</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>(1.12.2)</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>起源橡树（经典外观）</li>\n<li>神圣橡树（体型过大）</li>\n<li>巨型花朵（非树木）</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>兼容模组</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>以下模组的功能可与《生物群系大全》的动态树木模组良好融合，具有显著兼容性或已明确提供适配支持。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/better-foliage\" rel=\"nofollow\">更佳植被</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/dynamic-surroundings\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态环境</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/exotic-birds\" rel=\"nofollow\">异域鸟类</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tumbleweed\" rel=\"nofollow\">风滚草</a></span></span>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>配置选项</strong></strong></h2>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">本模组提供配置文件，允许启用或禁用以下功能：</span></p>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\">(1.12.2)</span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">柿子树（若启用，世界生成时将生成柿子树，此时秋季树、枫树和枯树将不再掉落柿子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">桃树（若启用，世界生成时将生成桃树，此时繁花橡树、蓝花楹和桃花心木将不再掉落桃子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">梨树（若启用，世界生成时将生成梨树，此时红树林和柳树将不再掉落梨子）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">杨树种子&nbsp;（若启用，杨树变种将掉落专属种子，可在林地区域外种植）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>其他插件</strong></strong></h2>\n<p>其他模组的动态树木插件可在<a href=\"https://github.com/DynamicTreesTeam/DynamicTrees/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木维基</a>中查找。</p>\n<h4><strong>建议与请求：</strong></h4>\n<p>如需申请新模组的兼容支持，请在此处提交！！：<br><a href=\"https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/orgs/DynamicTreesTeam/discussions/categories/compatibility-addon-suggestions</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>前置要求</strong></strong></h2>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木<br></a>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物群系大全</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>许可与整合包</strong></h2>\n<p>欢迎将此模组加入任何整合包，无需事先征得同意。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如有任何问题，请在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/MZ56Cuc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 上联系我。</strong></span></p>",
